flowchart LR
    A[Authenticated submitter] --> B[Transactional commercial-distribution service]
    B --> C{Entitlement + feature gate}
    C -->|Denied| D[Explainable rejection + audit]
    C -->|Allowed| E[Lock quota bucket]
    E --> F{Idempotency key / job exists?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Return same reservation and job]
    F -->|No| H{Consumed + held + quantity <= limit?}
    H -->|Deny overage| I[Quota rejection + audit]
    H -->|Allow| J[Insert HELD reservation]
    J --> K[Insert distribution job + outbox in same transaction]
    K --> L[Queue worker]
    L -->|Success| M[Atomically HELD -> CONSUMED]
    L -->|Cancel / terminal failure| N[Atomically HELD -> RELEASED]
    L -->|Lease heartbeat| O[Extend reservation expiry]
    P[Reservation sweeper] -->|Expired, non-running only| N
    M --> Q[Immutable usage event + audit/SIEM export]
    N --> Q
